  "description": "Type-subtype classification linkbase \u2014 general-special arcs that classify rs-gaap concepts into reporting networks (CurrentAssets, Revenues, OperatingExpenses, etc.). RoboSystems canonical fork (frozen 2026-04-19). Originally derived from Charlie Hoffman's type-subtype-usgaap linkbase; edits happen in this JSON-LD, upstream XBRL is not tracked. Pure arc enrichment on rs-gaap.",
