      "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
        {
          "@language": "en-US",
          "@value": "Contracts in which the counterparties exchange a series of cash payments based on (a) an equity index and (b) a fixed or floating interest rate on a notional principal amount. Equity swap contracts typically are tied to a stock index, but sometimes they relate to a particular stock or a defined basket of stocks."
        }
      ],
